{"sourceUrl":"https://scbg.cas.cn/yjs/kjxt/xly/202604/t20260427_8191909.html","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:51:51.557715+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://scbg.cas.cn/yjs/kjxt/xly/202604/t20260427_8191909.html","html":"<div>\n<div>\n<h1>2026年优秀大学生“华植风采”夏令营活动通知</h1>\n<div>\n<div>\n<span>发布日期：2026.04.27</span>\n<span>作者：</span>\n<span>\n                                            | 【 \n                                            <a>A</a>\n<a>A</a>\n<a>A</a>\n                                             】 |\n                                        </span>\n<a href=\"https://scbg.cas.cn/yjs/kjxt/xly/202604/t20260427_8191909.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">【打印】</a>\n<a href=\"https://scbg.cas.cn/yjs/kjxt/xly/202604/t20260427_8191909.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">【关闭】</a>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div><p><span>为引导大学生认识华南植物园各学科的前沿热点和产业前景，了解华南植物园的历史沿革、创新文化和科研氛围，激发大学生的科研兴趣和思维，了解科研方法与过程。华南植物园将在广州举办</span><span>2026</span><span>年</span><span>“</span><span>华植风采</span><span>”</span><span>优秀大学生夏令营活动。欢迎有兴趣的</span><span>2027</span><span>届优秀应届本科毕业生报名参加。</span></p><p><strong><span>一、活动时间</span></strong><strong> </strong></p><p><span>拟定于</span><span>2026</span><span>年</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>13-16</span><span>日</span> </p><p><strong><span>二、活动内容</span></strong><strong> </strong></p><p><span>园概况及研究生培养情况介绍、专家学术报告、</span> <span>师生交流、综合考核；华南国家植物园参观学习活动等。</span></p><p><strong><span>三、拟接收人数</span></strong></p><p><span>60-80</span><span>人。</span></p><p><strong><span>四、申请条件</span></strong> </p><p><span>1.</span><span>双一流高校及学科（专业）优势突出的国内重点高校</span><span>2027</span><span>届毕业生，专业为生物学、生态学、园艺学、环境科学、林学及相关专业。</span><span> </span></p><p><span>2.</span><span>科研兴趣浓厚、具有科研潜力，学习成绩优秀。</span></p><p><span>3.</span><span>优先录取科研成果突出者。</span></p><p><strong><span>五、申报流程</span></strong><strong> </strong></p><p><span>1.</span><span>个人信息申报：申请人请登陆中国科学院大学</span><span>“</span><span>科教协同</span><span>”</span><span>网站（</span><span>http://zxsq.ucas.ac.cn/</span><span>），进入</span><span>“</span><span>大学生夏令营报名（学生）</span><span>”</span><span>入口，进行注册。</span><span>“</span><span>承办夏令营单位</span><span>”</span><span>中选择</span><span>“</span><span>华南植物园</span><span>”</span><span>，</span><span>“</span><span>夏令营名称</span><span>”</span><span>中选择</span><span>“</span><span>华植风采大学生夏令营</span><span>”</span><span>。请完整填写全部内容，并在</span><span>“</span><span>备注</span><span>”</span><span>栏中注明拟申请专业。（植物学、生物化学与分子植物学、园艺学、生态学、园林植物与观赏园艺、野生动植物保护与利用、生物与医药专业学位、资源与环境）。</span></p><p><span>2.</span><span>网上报名截止时间为：</span><span>6</span><span>月</span><span>15</span><span>日</span><span>24:00</span><span>。</span> </p><p><span>3.</span><span>资格审核：预计</span><span>6</span><span>月底</span><span>7</span><span>月初在华南植物园网站公布名单，未入选者不再另行通知。凡录取的营员需在公布之日起</span><span>5</span><span>日内登录系统确认是否参加，逾期视为主动放弃。</span></p><p><strong> </strong><strong><span>六、申请材料</span></strong> </p><p><span>1.</span><span>在报名系统中打印的《夏令营申请表》（本人签字）<span>。</span></span></p><p><span>2.</span><span>本科成绩单（需加盖教务处或院系公章）<span>。</span></span> </p><p><span>3.</span><span>专业排名证明（需加盖教务处或院系公章）</span><span>。</span></p><p><span>4.</span><span>英语水平证明（大学英语四、六级等相关英文能力证明）<span>。</span></span></p><p><span>5.</span><span>身份证和学生证复印件<span>。</span></span> </p><p><span>6.</span><span>已发表论文、奖状及各类证书等其他证明材料复印件。</span></p><p><span>申请人请于</span><span>6</span><span>月</span><span>15</span><span>日前将以下材料电子版按顺序合成</span><span>PDF</span><span>文件（大小不要超过</span><span>10M</span><span>），文件命名为</span><span>“</span><span>姓名</span><span>-</span><span>高校名称</span><span>-2026</span><span>年夏令营申请材料</span><span>”</span><span>，发送至邮箱</span><span>yzb@scbg.ac.cn</span><span>。</span></p><p><strong><span>七、其他事项</span></strong></p><p><span>1.</span><span>夏令营期间，为营员提供免费食宿<span>。</span></span></p><p><span>2.</span><span>请自行安排交通，为营员提供交通补贴（其中省外标准</span><span>500</span><span>元</span><span>/</span><span>人，省内标准</span><span>200</span><span>元</span><span>/</span><span>人）。</span></p><p><span>3.</span><span>夏令营报到时需签署安全协议。</span></p><p><span>4.</span><span>以上为初步安排，若遇不可抗拒因素需临时调整，以实际公布安排为准。</span></p><p><strong><span>八、联系方式</span></strong><strong> </strong></p><p><span>单位网址：</span><span>http://www.scbg.ac.cn </span></p><p><span>联系部门：中国科学院华南植物园研究生部</span>   </p><p><span>联系人：李老师</span><span>  </span><span>马老师</span> </p><p><span>联系电话：</span><span>020-37252851 020-37252882   </span></p><p><span>邮</span>    <span>箱：</span><span>yzb@scbg.ac.cn </span></p><p><span>单位地址：广东省广州市天河区兴科路</span><span>723</span><span>号</span></p><p><span>邮</span><span>    </span><span>编：</span><span>510650 </span></p><p><span>                </span></p><p><span>               中国科学院华南植物园研究生部</span></p><p><span>                      <span>2026</span><span>年4月27日</span> </span></p><p><br/></p></div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<hr/>\n<p>附件下载：</p>\n<ul>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://scbg.cas.cn/images/xl-right.png\"/>\n<span>下一篇：</span>\n<p><a href=\"https://scbg.cas.cn/yjs/kjxt/xly/202507/t20250704_7880065.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"2025年优秀大学生“华植风采”夏令营活动时间安排及入选名单\">2025年优秀大学生“华植风采”夏令营活动时间安排及入选名单</a></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>","textSha256":"07cbf5895c94ce39a6d4fe34a56d9bb862da31a25d2c7288a87f752143bc5255","textLength":1246,"sourceSha256":"9abcc6573316aca73fa0122fba6ddbf40fbf7ae629c8ad823ca3a1dba33e13c3","selector":"article-like:details-page","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-e58a032937e18d8d674f","title":"2026年中国科学院华南植物园2026年优秀大学生”华植风采”夏令营活动开始报名","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:51:51.557715+00:00"}
